                                        "entry_id": "de9db68c-9da5-3637-8346-ba437df3692b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of the Chabad movement in Judaism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a5efdec-0bca-4ccd-a5e6-36d4967ff69c",
                                                "sense_id": "805d6f78-1227-3015-85ac-41a010163217",
                                                "text": "The Chabadnikim, or Lubavitchers as they are sometimes called, are the largest Chassidim Jewish group in the world, thanks primarily to the efforts of the last rabbi in the Chassidim lineage, Menachem Mendel Schneerson, known to the Lubavitchers simply as “the Rebbe” (the Rabbi)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
